---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<section class="px-4 pt-14 pb-16 md:pt-20 md:pb-20" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <span class="bg-accent-start/10 text-bg-dark reveal mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-4 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="bg-accent-start size-1.5 rounded-full"></span>
        IT-Dienstleister aus Frankfurt am Main
      </span>

      <h1 id="hero-heading" class="reveal font-headline text-4xl font-medium leading-[1.1] tracking-tight md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        IT-Betreuung, Cloud und KI-Assistenten,<span class="text-gradient"> die einfach funktionieren.</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="reveal text-bg-dark/80 mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed md:text-lg">
        Von laufender IT-Betreuung über Cloud- und Sicherheitslösungen bis zu KI-Telefonassistent und WhatsApp-Chatbot:
        planbare Kosten, ein fester Ansprechpartner, keine Blackbox.
      </p>

      <div class="reveal mt-8 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <a
          href="/kontakt"
          class="bg-gradient-brand inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full px-6 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white"
        >
          Kostenloses Erstgespräch buchen
        </a>
        <a href="#leistungen" class="border-accent-start text-accent-start inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 px-2 text-base font-semibold">
          Leistungen ansehen
          <Icon name="arrow-right" class="size-4" aria-hidden="true" />
        </a>
      </div>

      <ul class="reveal text-bg-dark/68 mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-sm">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <Icon name="shield-check" class="text-accent-start size-4" aria-hidden="true" />
          Self-hosted in Deutschland
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <Icon name="check" class="text-accent-start size-4" aria-hidden="true" />
          Monatlich kündbar
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <Icon name="users" class="text-accent-start size-4" aria-hidden="true" />
          Fester Ansprechpartner
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
